# Docker Command Reference Table

| Command                                            | Description                                           |
| -------------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------- |
| `docker ps`                                        | List running containers                               |
| `docker ps -a`                                     | List all containers including stopped containers      |
| `docker images`                                    | List locally available Docker images                  |
| `docker image ls`                                  | Alternative command to list Docker images             |
| `docker pull <image>`                              | Download Docker image from Docker Hub                 |
| `docker pull alpine:3.22.4`                        | Pull Alpine Linux image                               |
| `docker pull nginx`                                | Pull Nginx image                                      |
| `docker run <image>`                               | Create and start container                            |
| `docker run -d <image>`                            | Run container in detached/background mode             |
| `docker run -p HOST:CONTAINER <image>`             | Map host port to container port                       |
| `docker run -itd --name webapp01 -p 8080:80 nginx` | Run Nginx container with custom name and port mapping |
| `docker exec -it <container> /bin/bash`            | Access container terminal interactively               |
| `docker exec <container> ls`                       | List files/directories inside container               |
| `docker exec <container> mkdir sample`             | Create directory inside container                     |
| `docker cp index.html <container>:/sample`         | Copy file from host to container                      |
| `echo "hello" > /usr/share/nginx/html/index.html`  | Create or modify Nginx web page                       |
| `docker info`                                      | Display Docker system information                     |
| `docker inspect <container_or_image>`              | Show detailed container/image information             |
| `docker image inspect alpine:latest`               | Inspect Docker image details                          |
| `docker history customimage:v1`                    | Show Docker image layer history                       |
| `docker commit <container> customimage:v1`         | Create image from container                           |
| `docker save -o customimage.tar customimage:v1`    | Save Docker image as tar archive                      |
| `docker load -i customimage.tar`                   | Load Docker image from tar file                       |
| `docker tag webapp:v1 abhima/webapp:v1`            | Create new tag for Docker image                       |
| `docker login -u <username>`                       | Login to Docker Hub                                   |
| `docker push abhima/webapp:v1`                     | Push Docker image to Docker Hub                       |
| `docker rmi <image_id>`                            | Remove Docker image                                   |
| `docker rmi -f <image_id>`                         | Force remove Docker image                             |
| `docker stop <container>`                          | Stop running container                                |
| `docker rm $(docker ps -aq)`                       | Remove all containers                                 |
| `docker image prune -a`                            | Remove unused Docker images                           |
| `docker system prune -a`                           | Remove unused containers, networks and images         |
| `docker logs -f <container>`                       | View live container logs                              |
| `docker stats`                                     | View real-time container resource usage               |
| `docker diff <container>`                          | Show file changes inside container                    |
| `docker build -t webapp:v1 .`                      | Build Docker image using Dockerfile                   |
| `docker volume ls`                                 | List Docker volumes                                   |
| `docker volume create data_web`                    | Create Docker volume                                  |
| `docker volume inspect data_web`                   | Inspect Docker volume details                         |
| `docker volume rm data_web`                        | Remove Docker volume                                  |
| `docker network ls`                                | List Docker networks                                  |
| `docker network create mynet`                      | Create custom Docker network                          |
| `docker network inspect mynet`                     | Inspect Docker network                                |
| `docker network connect mynet web-app`             | Connect container to custom network                   |
| `docker network disconnect bridge web-app`         | Disconnect container from network                     |
| `docker exec <container> ping <ip>`                | Test network connectivity between containers          |
